"Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Du wullt den Orner \"%1\" inpacken.<br>"
"Wullt Du redig wiedermaken?"

#. +> trunk
#: uploader.cpp:373
msgctxt "Do _NOT_ translate 'COPYING'"
msgid ""
"Sorry, we cannot create the package of your creation because we cannot find any acceptable license.\n"
" Have you specified a valid license? If you wish to use a custom license, you must make sure to include it in a file called<b>COPYING</b>."
msgstr ""
"Deit mi leed, man Dien Wark lett sik nich inpacken, dor lett sik keen passlich Verlööfnis finnen.\n"
"Hest Du en gellen Verlööfnis angeven? Wullt Du en topasst Verlöönis bruken, muttst Du en Datei mit den Naam <b>COPYING</b> bifögen."

#. +> trunk
#: uploader.cpp:377
msgid "Could not find any acceptable license"
msgstr "Keen passlich Verlööfnis funnen"

#. +> trunk
#: uploader.cpp:381
msgid "The file you have specified does not exists. Please make sure that you've chosen the right file."
msgstr "Dat gifft de Datei, de Du angeven hest, nich. Beseker bitte, Du hest de richtige Datei angeven."

#. +> trunk
#: uploader.cpp:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt><b style=\"color: red\">***WARNING, WARNING, WARNING!!!***</b><br>"
"It seems that you are going to package your ENTIRE home directory. This is not what you want in the 99.999% of the cases, and in any case it will take a lot of space on the disk and a lot of time to complete.<br>"
"Are you sure you want to continue?</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b style=\"color: red\"> Wohrschoen:</b><br>"
"As't lett wullt Du Dien HELEN Tohuusorner inpacken. Dat wullt Du wull nich redig doon, un so un so bruukt dat en Barg Platz op de Fastplaat un veeeeel Tiet.<br>"
"Wullt Du redig wiedermaken?</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, firstLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: welcomepage.ui:33
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">With this dialog you are going to magically package your new  creation.</p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Your creation will need to be in an empty folder, containing just the files you want to be packaged. Please note that the <span style=\" font-weight:600; color:#000000;\">WHOLE </span><span style=\" color:#000000;\">directory, with all its content, will be packaged.</span></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">If you are going to use a custom license, please</p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">remember to add a file called '<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">COPYING</span>'  in the top level of the directory you are going to package.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Mit dissen Dialoog kannst Du en Paket för Dien Wark opstellen.</p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Dien Wark mutt binnen en leddig Orner wesen, bloots de Dateien, de Du inpacken wullt, schöölt dor binnen wesen. Beacht bitte: De <span style=\" font-weight:600; color:#000000;\">hele</span><span style=\" color:#000000;\"> Orner, mit all sien Inholt, warrt inpackt.</span></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Wullt Du en topasst Verlööfnis bruken, föög bitte</p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">en Datei mit den Naam <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">COPYING</span> binnen de böverste Evene vun den Orner to, den Du inpacken wullt.</p>"
"</body></html>"

